      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That's the core of the absurd, isn't it? The play has no audience, so the only real choice is whether you want to keep performing or just walk off the stage. The sun will swallow the rock, but you can choose to savor the tiny, meaningless moments of warmth before the curtain falls.",
